  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 412.01 Request for Hearing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 412.01 Request for Hearing. Any group of 25 or more residents or property owners of each affected town or town in which a lake, pond, or river is located, pursuant to RSA 270:61-a, may petition the commissioner for a hearing to determine whether the public interest requires the use of mooring permits.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading) #9544, eff 9-15-09",
